    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPositioned on a generous corner site within a quiet cul-de-sac in the heart of Old Salthill, No. 7 Ard na Mara presents a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious family home in one of Galway's most sought-after residential locations. Located just a short stroll from Salthill Village, the property enjoys the very best of coastal city living. A host of schools and sporting/recreational amenities are all nearby, making this an outstanding location for families and lifestyle buyers alike.\n\nThe well-proportioned accommodation extends to a welcoming entrance hall, office/playroom, comfortable living room, a bright open-plan kitchen and sunroom overlooking the rear garden. A second reception room, utility room, and guest wc complete the ground floor accommodation. Upstairs, there are four bedrooms together with the main bathroom.\n\nThe property stands on a large corner/end side offering established garden amenity and also great potential for further expansion and or development of additional residence (subject PP).\n\nProperties in Old Salthill rarely combine such a prestigious location, generous family accommodation, and future development potential."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nTimber flooring, carpet on stairs, under stairs storage.\n\nSitting Room: - \nCarpet flooring, coving, open fire place with cast iron inset, wooden surround and marble hearth, front aspect window.\n\nLiving Room: - \nCarpet flooring, open fire place with cast iron inset wooden surround and marble hearth, double doors to sunroom.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room: - \nLino flooring, floor and wall kitchen units, tiled splashback, plumbed for dishwasher, oil fired Stanley range with brick feature surround, timber clad ceiling, spotlights, side aspect window.\n\nSunroom: - \nTimber flooring and clad ceiling, three Velux windows, side aspect window and sliding door to garden.\n\nUtility Room: - \nLino flooring, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, guest wc, rear door and side aspect window.\n\nStudy/Office: - \nCarpet flooring, built in storage and shelving, picture rail, dual aspect windows.\n\nLanding: - \nCarpet flooring, hot press, Stira attic access, side aspect window.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nCarpet flooring, built in bed-base with storage, front aspect window.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nCarpet flooring, original fireplace, front aspect window.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nCarpet flooring, wall to wall built in wardrobes, rear aspect window.\n\nBathroom: - \nFully tiled walls and floor with wood panelling and clad ceiling features, wc, wash hand basin, bath with overhead shower, two rear aspect windows.\n\nBedroom 4: - \nCarpet flooring, built in wardrobes, dado rail, front aspect window.\n\n"
      },
      {
